This directory contains files derived from the Supabase self-hosted Docker
distribution (https://github.com/supabase/supabase, docker/ at tag
self-hosted/v0.8.0), licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see
LICENSE-supabase). volumes/db/*.sql, utils/generate-keys.sh and volumes/api/envoy/*
(except cds.yaml) are vendored unmodified. volumes/api/envoy/cds.yaml has ONE deliberate
change: `dns_lookup_family: V4_ONLY` on every cluster, because Envoy's resolver failed
against Docker's embedded DNS on Synology DSM without it (every upstream stayed empty
and the gateway answered 503). Re-apply it when updating that file.
docker-compose.yml is an excerpt of the upstream
compose file (services not used by Sho-ERP removed). No Supabase service source
code is included: only container configuration that pulls official images.
